{"version":1,"content":"<p>多名美國高級官員11月13日表示，美國總統當勞·特朗普預計不會在下周訪華期間，向中國國家主席習近平提及圍繞英偉達前行政總裁黃仁勳及艾麗絲·黃的爭議。特朗普計劃於11月18日至19日前往深圳出席亞太經合組織峯會；白宮稱，他還計劃與習近平及俄羅斯總統弗拉基米爾·普京舉行三方會晤。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586356.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:01:12.978746+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:43:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T06:54:26.338918+00:00","content_hash":"cb2710e59b0e4c82bb7f3c17d2ddc7e235858232f1de968fa59bf400d86e79c0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}